{
  "name": "Lead capture to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Lead capture to Google Sheets\n\nReceives submissions from your form or landing page and saves each one as a row in Google Sheets.\n\n**How it works:** the webhook receives the lead, checks that it has a valid email, normalizes the fields and appends a row.\n\n**You need:** a Google Sheets credential (OAuth) and a sheet with the headers: name, email, message, received_at.\n\n**Setup:** follow steps 1 to 3 below.\n\nFree template from kyndredai.com/templates. Runs on n8n 2.x, self-hosted or cloud.",
        "height": 312,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        28
      ],
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "name": "README"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-capture",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
      "name": "Receive lead (Webhook)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "155b0625-8dd8-45fd-86a7-51ce130e0d60",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.body.email || '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ],
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
      "name": "Has a valid email?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "732f3c39-81d6-4cf4-8926-975ddb137876",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.name || '').trim().slice(0, 100) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b97c7e4c-023d-44dc-8669-1863d42362a8",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.email).trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5a6ea8c5-883a-44de-8d48-6109d02b21c6",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.message || '').trim().slice(0, 2000) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "edf6cb51-d5ef-4e53-8f3e-3f52d48c4b22",
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
      "name": "Normalize fields"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555",
      "name": "Save to Google Sheets",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        600
      ],
      "id": "a01d1fdf-4692-43fe-8594-75768508f535",
      "name": "Discard (no valid email)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Connect your form\n\nPoint your form or landing page at this webhook URL (method **POST**, JSON body).\n\nExpected fields in the body:\n- name\n- email\n- message\n\nThe webhook has no authentication. Before going live, add Header Auth on the webhook node and send the same header from your form backend.\n\n*Tip:* click **Listen for test event** and send a test POST.",
        "height": 438,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        800
      ],
      "id": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666",
      "name": "Setup 1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Validation\n\nSubmissions without a well-formed email go to the discard branch, so they never become rows. Name and message are trimmed and cut at 100 and 2,000 characters.",
        "height": 207,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        310,
        800
      ],
      "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777",
      "name": "Validation note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Adjust the fields\n\n*Normalize fields* decides which value goes to each column. Change or add fields to match your form.\n\nDefault: **name, email, message, received_at** (the date is filled in automatically).",
        "height": 249,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        800
      ],
      "id": "88888888-8888-4888-8888-888888888888",
      "name": "Setup 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Connect Google Sheets\n\n1. Open *Save to Google Sheets*, Credential, *Create new*, and connect your Google account.\n2. Pick the **document** and the **sheet**.\n3. Mapping is *Map Automatically*: it matches by column name.\n\nThe sheet headers must match: **name, email, message, received_at**.\n\nCell format is **RAW**, so a submitted value that starts with `=` is stored as text and never runs as a formula.",
        "height": 417,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1010,
        800
      ],
      "id": "99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999",
      "name": "Setup 3"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receive lead (Webhook)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has a valid email?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has a valid email?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
